       "html": "<p><em>Old Ireland in Colour</em> celebrates the rich history of Ireland and the Irish through a color restoration of stunning images of all walks of Irish life, and the Irish abroad, throughout the nineteenth and twentieth centuries.  </p><p>With over 170 photographs from all four provinces meticulously colorized by John Breslin through a combination of cutting-edge artificial intelligence technology and his own historical research, each image has been exquisitely transformed and brought to life.  Each breathtaking picture has been captioned by historian, Sarah-Ann-Buckley, and revitalizes scenes we thought we knew.</p><p>Since the project began, it has gone viral on social media-gaining more than 45,000 followers on Facebook and 55,000 followers on Instagram.</p><p>If you are looking for the perfect Irish gift, then look no further.  You can purchase it on Amazon for about $25.  I guarantee it will bring you a lot of visual joy and make someone in your life very happy.  </p><p><em>Written by Taryn Harrison</em></p>"
